{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 5, "model_name": "google/gemma-3n-e2b-it", "content": "Hark gentle traveler to Japan's fair shore\nA journey grand a tale to explore\nFrom ancient lands to modern grace\nA wondrous voyage time cannot erase.\n\n**Day 1: Arrival in Tokyo a City Bright**\n\nUpon arrival at Narita's gate\nReceive thy welcome seal thy fate\nTo Shinjuku's heights a bustling scene\nWhere neon lights a vibrant sheen.\nDine on ramen rich and bold\nA story in each bowl unfolds.\nRest thy weary head at night\nAnd dream of wonders burning bright.\n\n**Day 2: Tokyo's Temples and Traditions**\n\nTo Asakusa's temple we shall go\nWhere Senso-ji's incense doth flow\nExplore the Nakamise-dori street\nWhere trinkets sweet and flavors meet.\nThen wander through Ueno Park's green space\nAnd find thy solace time and place.\nObserve the geishas glide with grace\nA fleeting beauty in this place.\n\n**Day 3: Hakone's Beauty a Mountain's Kiss**\n\nA journey forth to Hakone's height\nWhere mountains rise in misty light\nA cruise upon Lake Ashi we'll take\nWith views of Fuji for goodness sake.\nThe Hakone Open-Air Museum grand\nA sculpture garden close at hand.\nEnjoy a soak in onsen's warm embrace\nAnd find tranquility in this serene place.\n\n**Day 4: Kyoto's Ancient Charm**\n\nBy train we journey swift and sure\nTo Kyoto's streets forever pure\nTo Gion district we shall roam\nWhere wooden machiya houses home.\nVisit Kiyomizu-dera's height\nA wooden stage a wondrous sight.\nExplore Fushimi Inari's gates\nA thousand torii sealed by fates.\n\n**Day 5: Kyoto's Golden Pavilion**\n\nKinkaku-ji a golden dream\nReflecting light a shimmering gleam\nRyoan-ji's zen garden deep\nWhere silent contemplation secrets keep.\nNijo Castle's history untold\nOf shoguns brave and stories bold.\nFind beauty in each passing hour\nA blossoming floral power.\n\n**Day 6: Nara's Deer and Todai-ji**\n\nTo Nara we shall make our way\nWhere friendly deer hold court each day\nTodai-ji's Great Buddha grand\nA marvel built by skillful hand.\nKasuga Taisha with lanterns bright\nA path of wishes bathed in light.\nObserve the peaceful woodland scene\nA tranquil haven ever green.\n\n**Day 7: Osaka's Culinary Delights**\n\nTo Osaka's city we now proceed\nWhere street food reigns a joyful deed\nDotonbori's vibrant gleam\nA culinary flowing stream.\nTakoyaki and okonomiyaki too\nA feast for eyes and palate true.\nExplore Osaka Castle's walls\nAnd heed the city's lively calls.\n\n**Day 8: Departure a Fond Farewell**\n\nWith heavy hearts we bid adieu\nTo Japan's wonders fresh and new\nReturn to Narita's gate we go\nA memory to brightly glow.\nThough journeys end and time may fly\nThe spirit of Japan will never die.\nFarewell dear land your beauty bright\nUntil we meet in future light.\n\n\n\n", "logprobs": [{"token": "H", "logprob": -0.002059364225715399}, {"token": "ark", "logprob": -1.2278481335670222e-05}, {"token": "▁gentle", "logprob": -0.6396634578704834}, {"token": "▁traveler", "logprob": -0.00865234062075615}, {"token": "▁to", "logprob": -0.10871680825948715}, {"token": "▁Japan", "logprob": -1.1130822896957397}, {"token": "'", "logprob": -0.026538338512182236}, {"token": "s", "logprob": -1.1920928244535389e-07}, {"token": "▁fair", "logprob": -0.44875529408454895}, {"token": "▁shore", "logprob": -0.31918537616729736}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": -0.045210618525743484}, {"token": "A", "logprob": -0.005320318508893251}, {"token": "▁journey", "logprob": -0.02375836670398712}, {"token": "▁grand", "logprob": -0.048508744686841965}, {"token": "▁a", "logprob": -0.2126697152853012}, {"token": "▁tale", "logprob": -1.7626681327819824}, {"token": "▁to", "logprob": -0.0015320956008508801}, {"token": "▁explore", "logprob": -0.314832478761673}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": -0.3225696384906769}, {"token": "From", "logprob": -0.2571593225002289}, {"token": "▁ancient", "logprob": -0.12901923060417175}, {"token": "▁lands", "logprob": -0.8591494560241699}, {"token": "▁